success_criteria:
  - Runtime.MiRust.com local folder is plain PHP docs when the IDE lock is gone, with private .uai and intake routes denied and .well-known/uaix-talisman.txt public.
  - SLMComposer.com remains the active Rust workspace and live browser-local app source.
  - No project server serves user model bytes or runs user-selected models.
  - MiniModel.org roadmap separates catalog metadata, peer-hosted bytes, user consent/import, manifest verification, and takedown/reporting responsibilities.
